encoding at `Q5` by it, then by the selector of the cell (a private multiplication that
drops `P5`); the block sums its 113 cells.
-/

namespace LwrProof

open Mxx.Primitives MxxRuntime MxxExponentLut

set_option maxRecDepth 100000

